{"unit_id":"suiyideali__dsh-selection-toolbar#card-1","repo":"suiyideali/dsh-selection-toolbar","commit":"c23430dad7bad3ec7c5389d893385b092e1036b2","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-selection-toolbar 是面向 DSH 网页会话的划词工具栏。在对话中选中文字后，它会在选区附近显示浮动操作栏，提供复制、插入 Markdown 引用、询问、解释、翻译和总结；AI 动作可在就地弹窗与当前对话之间切换。/btw 侧问从最近会话记录、选区和问题生成一次性回答，并显示在独立弹窗中。适合阅读长对话、理解术语或快速处理选中文本。需要 DSH web 和已配置的会话模型。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4-20","lib/client.js:2863-2913","lib/index.js:258-350"]}
{"unit_id":"suiyideali__dsh-selection-toolbar#card-2","repo":"suiyideali/dsh-selection-toolbar","commit":"c23430dad7bad3ec7c5389d893385b092e1036b2","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-selection-toolbar adds a floating toolbar to DSH web chats. Select text to copy or quote it, ask, explain, translate, or summarize. Answers can appear in a popup or enter the conversation. Its /btw console uses recent session context and the selection. Requires a configured session model.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:4-20","lib/client.js:2863-2913","lib/index.js:258-350"]}
