{"unit_id":"suiyideali__dsh-selection-toolbar#feature-1","repo":"suiyideali/dsh-selection-toolbar","commit":"c23430dad7bad3ec7c5389d893385b092e1036b2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「复制选中文本」：在会话中划选文字后点击复制，内容写入剪贴板；客户端也提供兼容回退。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:7-10","lib/client.js:1887-1912"]}
