{"unit_id":"suiyideali__dsh-selection-toolbar#feature-4","repo":"suiyideali/dsh-selection-toolbar","commit":"c23430dad7bad3ec7c5389d893385b092e1036b2","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"「/btw 侧问」：输入问题后，插件把问题、选区和最近会话内容交给当前模型生成回答；答案显示在侧问弹窗，不写入会话消息。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:1830-1858","lib/index.js:292-350"]}
